  battleCanvas: {fileID: 0}
  eventSystem: {fileID: 0}
  initalLines:
  - "I\u2019ve been expecting you, charName."
  - Many students have stood in your place before.
  - To channel electric magic, you have to recognize and harness the power of each
    cyrstal.
  - Go sort them in order of ascending energy.
  afterPuzzleLines:
  - You sure took your sweet time with that.
  - "I trust you\u2019ve memorized them thoroughly, then."
  - Show me what you know.
  afterBattleLines:
  - Not bad.
  - "I think you\u2019re ready to learn a new spell."
  - "Watch closely\u2026you have to stay within the correct charging tolerances."
  afterSpellLines:
  - This is about as far I take you in your journey.
  - Best of luck.
